Reason: with ENFORCE_VIRTUAL_FILES_SYNC_FOLDER ON, the sync options page showed "Synchronize everything" and
"Choose what to sync" greyed out, "Download files on-demand" under "Virtual files", and a "Local sync folder"
section whose Choose button is disabled. Hide the two rows and the folder section when classic sync is unavailable
and drop the description; the client still uses its default folder. Against nextcloud/desktop v34.0.7
(1e5b93f08b8ce07ffb3ad47d7def17df469b189c). No effect when classic sync is available (enforcement off, or virtual
files unsupported on the PC).
